0%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">极限解放\n</th>\n<td><div class=\"gx_box\">\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"单打独斗\" class=\"bili-tt gx_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%8D%95%E6%89%93%E7%8B%AC%E6%96%97\" title=\"极限解放/单打独斗\"><img alt=\"技能背景 史诗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/65px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/98px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"单打独斗\" class=\"bili-tt gx_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%8D%95%E6%89%93%E7%8B%AC%E6%96%97\" title=\"极限解放/单打独斗\"><img alt=\"极限解放 单打独斗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/061th55iv1cnjio0f79lujlguzirhys.png/65px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%8D%95%E6%89%93%E7%8B%AC%E6%96%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/061th55iv1cnjio0f79lujlguzirhys.png/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%8D%95%E6%89%93%E7%8B%AC%E6%96%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/ff/061th55iv1cnjio0f79lujlguzirhys.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%8D%95%E6%89%93%E7%8B%AC%E6%96%97\" title=\"极限解放/单打独斗\"><font color=\"#FFF\">单打独斗</font></a></div>\n    </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>sp列奥\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>如下\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by Azhar-_-】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1Foao65ED9\">https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1Foao65ED9</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>徐翔\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>竹内良太\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【by ThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1rVam6DEnm\">https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1rVam6DEnm</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>十几年前，列奥尼德还只是法皇国光辉禁军中的一名卫士。他沉默寡言，却始终守护在卡丽丝身边，守护着她与她悉心照料的孤儿们。北境宗教动乱爆发后，光辉禁军群龙无首，战火与仇恨迅速失控，卡丽丝珍视的孩子们也在混乱中死去。自那之后，卡丽丝踏上了更加决绝的道路，而列奥尼德则把“守护光辉、肃清叛乱”的誓言刻进骨血，成为平乱战场上最可靠、也最冷酷的支柱。凭借这份功绩与实力，他甚至一度被推举为光辉禁军统帅，却最终拒绝了那份荣耀，只愿继续以卫士队长的身份守在卡丽丝身旁。<br />\n<p>然而，当列奥尼德被教廷击败，并遭维瑟珀拉借璀璨之光的力量篡改意识。他失去了与卡丽丝相关的记忆，只剩下“为光辉而战、肃清叛军”的誓言在驱使他行动。如今的列奥尼德，是被重塑后的最强光辉战士，也是一个被剥夺了情感与过往、却仍执着于守护某种信条的冷酷存在。冰冷的重甲回荡着永不止息的肃清誓言。但没人知道，在层层铁幕深处，那抹被战火吞噬的余温，究竟是早已熄灭……还是在等待着被再度点燃。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>角色像素模型\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"列奥尼德•寒锋血誓 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/m5cg8ijc9sw0exuyhlltli0pp5p9bqb.png/100px-%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7%E2%80%A2%E5%AF%92%E9%94%8B%E8%A1%80%E8%AA%93_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/20/m5cg8ijc9sw0exuyhlltli0pp5p9bqb.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022020703\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.268 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.454 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1797/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7051/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 399/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  321.168      1 模板:角色\n100.00%  321.168      1 -total\n 57.02%  183.131      1 模板:技能树\n 48.31%  155.160     15 模板:技能图\n  7.30%   23.440      1 模板:面包屑\n  5.08%   16.321      1 模板:个性图\n  4.04%   12.987      1 模板:极限解放图\n  1.91%    6.140      1 模板:立绘\n  1.91%    6.132      1 模板:兵种图\n  0.97%    3.129      2 模板:阵营图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:9197-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022020703 and revision id 22501. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"角色","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"可邂逅角色","missing":true}],"images":["立绘_列奥尼德•寒锋血誓.png","立绘_列奥尼德•寒锋血誓（五星）.png","文字_传说.png","职业图标背景_毁灭者.png","职业图标_毁灭者.png","阵营图标_法皇国.png","阵营图标_列阵如林.png","技能背景_史诗.png","个性_血誓枪魂.png","技能背景_卓越.png","技能_协防.png","技能_先登烈锋突.png","技能_封印击（剑）.png","技能背景_传说.png","技能_血枪刺.png","技能_枪锋屹立.png","技能_血誓缚链.png","技能_威风凛冽.png","技能_硬化.png","技能_犯者必诛.png","技能_枪魂•一骑荡千军.png","技能_怒喝.png","技能_冲锋追击.png